OL,5,G0700 Sunday Breakfast
OL,6,     FThe big news and sports stories,
OL,7,     Fweather, plus previews of the
OL,8,     Fweekend's sport with Jeanette
OL,9,     FKwakye and Steffan Powell. Text:
OL,10,     F85058 (charged at your standard
OL,11,     Fmessage rate).
OL,12,G1000 Colin Murray
OL,13,     FColin sets up your day of sport
OL,14,     Fand beyond with a Sunday morning
OL,15,     Fmix of special guests, special
OL,16,     Fconversations and special radio.
OL,17,G1200 5 Live Sport
OL,18,     FMaz Farooki builds up to the day's
OL,19,     Fsporting action including the
OL,20,     FCommonwealth Games, with swimming
OL,21,     Ffinals, plus the Hungarian Grand
OL,22,     FPrix and The Hundred.
